    "created_at": "2016-10-11T14:58:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-11T14:58:41Z",
    "body": "And yes, I think the right fix is for the task queued in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#update-the-image-data step 9.2 to check the \"If another instance of this algorithm for this img element was started after this instance\" thing....\n",
